  "text": {
    "formatted": "You gain one of the following feature options of your choice. Whenever you finish a Short or Long Rest, you can replace the chosen option with the other one.\n\n_**Escape the Horde.**_ Opportunity Attacks have Disadvantage against you.\n\n_**Multiattack Defense.**_ When a creature hits you with an attack roll, that creature has Disadvantage on all other attack rolls against you this turn.",
